<spell-notebook "sticky examples">
	<header level="1">
		Sticky
		<header>Sticky content stays fixed to the viewport while its container is on screen.</>
	</>
	<sticky-tab-bar showing="examples"/>
	<section>
		<menu class="ui-docs-section-tabs" appearance="segmented" aria-label="Sections">
			<item link="#introduction">Introduction</>
			<item link="#examples">Examples</>
		</>
	</>

	<!--
		EXAMPLES:  Fomantic's sticky page (its first tab is Examples:  Introduction, then the examples).  Scroll the PAGE:
		each sticky sticks 64px from the top, below the site's bar, while its column (its parent) is on screen.
		- Fomantic puts the stickies in `left` / `right` rails OUTSIDE the segment;  here the site's own nav and "On this
		  page" columns sit there, so the stickies go in `stretched` grid columns beside the content instead.
	-->
	<section label="Introduction">
		<markdown>
			Sticky content stays fixed to the browser viewport while another column of content is visible on the page.

			Although sticky content can be used inside any container, sticky pairs well with `<ui-rail>`, because "stuck"
			content often occupies additional canvas space outside the main content of a website, making sure follow-up
			links, ads and other ancillary content remain on screen while the reader engages with the main content.
		</>
		<message state="warning" size="small">The following examples work best on a large display: on a phone the columns get narrow.</>
	</>

	<section label="Examples">
		<section label="Sticking to Adjacent Context" sticky collapsible dividing>
			<example description="Sticky content attaches itself to the viewport when it is passed, and stays fixed to the viewport until it collides with the bottom edge of its context. Additional static content can exist above sticky content without affecting its position.">
				<message slot="description" state="info" size="small"><html>The context is the sticky's PARENT, here a stretched <code>&lt;ui-column&gt;</code> (Fomantic uses rails outside the segment, where this site keeps its own columns). Fomantic's <code>context</code> setting (any element) has no CSS equivalent, so put the sticky inside the element it belongs to.</html></message>
				<segment>
					<grid>
						<column width="4" stretched>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<sticky offset="64">
								<header level="3">Stuck Content</header>
								<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt=""/>
							</sticky>
						</column>
						<column width="8">
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
						</column>
						<column width="4" stretched>
							<sticky offset="64">
								<header level="3">Stuck Content</header>
								<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt=""/>
							</sticky>
						</column>
					</grid>
				</segment>
			</example>
		</>

		<section label="Pushing" sticky="stack" collapsible dividing>
			<example description="With `pushing` the viewport \"pushes\" the sticky content: it sticks to the top while scrolling down past it, and waits at the bottom edge (`bottom-offset` from it) while it is still below the fold.">
				<segment>
					<grid>
						<column width="4" stretched>
							<sticky offset="64" bottom-offset="16" pushing>
								<header level="3">Stuck Content</header>
								<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt=""/>
							</sticky>
						</column>
						<column width="8">
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
						</column>
						<column width="4" stretched>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""/>
							<sticky offset="64" bottom-offset="16" pushing>
								<header level="3">Stuck Content</header>
								<image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt=""/>
							</sticky>
						</column>
					</grid>
				</segment>
			</example>
		</>

		<!-- GAP I67:  the narrow column stacks the items, so each tiny image grows to the column width (fixed in source;  shows after the next site build). -->
		<section label="Oversized Content" sticky collapsible dividing>
			<example description="Sticky content that is larger than the viewport stays where the page puts it: a `position: sticky` box taller than the view scrolls with the page until its end is reached, then sticks.">
				<message slot="description" size="small" class="site-not-ported"><html>Not ported: Fomantic's scrolling of oversized content against the scroll direction -- the browser's <code>position: sticky</code> does the sticking, with no scroll listener.</html></message>
				<html>
					<ui-segment>
						<ui-grid>
							<ui-column width="4" stretched>
								<ui-sticky offset="64">
									<ui-header level="3">Long Stuck Content</ui-header>
									<ui-items divided>
										<ui-item>
											<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt="" size="tiny"></ui-image>
											<ui-content vertical-align="middle">
												<ui-header link="#followup">Followup Article</ui-header>
												<ui-meta>By <a href="#author">Author</a></ui-meta>
											</ui-content>
										</ui-item>
										<ui-item>
											<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt="" size="tiny"></ui-image>
											<ui-content vertical-align="middle">
												<ui-header link="#followup">Followup Article</ui-header>
												<ui-meta>By <a href="#author">Author</a></ui-meta>
											</ui-content>
										</ui-item>
										<ui-item>
											<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt="" size="tiny"></ui-image>
											<ui-content vertical-align="middle">
												<ui-header link="#followup">Followup Article</ui-header>
												<ui-meta>By <a href="#author">Author</a></ui-meta>
											</ui-content>
										</ui-item>
										<ui-item>
											<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt="" size="tiny"></ui-image>
											<ui-content vertical-align="middle">
												<ui-header link="#followup">Followup Article</ui-header>
												<ui-meta>By <a href="#author">Author</a></ui-meta>
											</ui-content>
										</ui-item>
										<ui-item>
											<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt="" size="tiny"></ui-image>
											<ui-content vertical-align="middle">
												<ui-header link="#followup">Followup Article</ui-header>
												<ui-meta>By <a href="#author">Author</a></ui-meta>
											</ui-content>
										</ui-item>
										<ui-item>
											<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt="" size="tiny"></ui-image>
											<ui-content vertical-align="middle">
												<ui-header link="#followup">Followup Article</ui-header>
												<ui-meta>By <a href="#author">Author</a></ui-meta>
											</ui-content>
										</ui-item>
										<ui-item>
											<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt="" size="tiny"></ui-image>
											<ui-content vertical-align="middle">
												<ui-header link="#followup">Followup Article</ui-header>
												<ui-meta>By <a href="#author">Author</a></ui-meta>
											</ui-content>
										</ui-item>
										<ui-item>
											<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt="" size="tiny"></ui-image>
											<ui-content vertical-align="middle">
												<ui-header link="#followup">Followup Article</ui-header>
												<ui-meta>By <a href="#author">Author</a></ui-meta>
											</ui-content>
										</ui-item>
										<ui-item>
											<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt="" size="tiny"></ui-image>
											<ui-content vertical-align="middle">
												<ui-header link="#followup">Followup Article</ui-header>
												<ui-meta>By <a href="#author">Author</a></ui-meta>
											</ui-content>
										</ui-item>
										<ui-item>
											<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt="" size="tiny"></ui-image>
											<ui-content vertical-align="middle">
												<ui-header link="#followup">Followup Article</ui-header>
												<ui-meta>By <a href="#author">Author</a></ui-meta>
											</ui-content>
										</ui-item>
										<ui-item>
											<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt="" size="tiny"></ui-image>
											<ui-content vertical-align="middle">
												<ui-header link="#followup">Followup Article</ui-header>
												<ui-meta>By <a href="#author">Author</a></ui-meta>
											</ui-content>
										</ui-item>
										<ui-item>
											<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/image.png" alt="" size="tiny"></ui-image>
											<ui-content vertical-align="middle">
												<ui-header link="#followup">Followup Article</ui-header>
												<ui-meta>By <a href="#author">Author</a></ui-meta>
											</ui-content>
										</ui-item>
									</ui-items>
								</ui-sticky>
							</ui-column>
							<ui-column width="8">
								<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""></ui-image>
								<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""></ui-image>
								<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""></ui-image>
								<ui-image src="/components/ui/images/wireframe/paragraph.png" alt=""></ui-image>
